    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622200/extras/232f487fa387d2d4d8de766c7458ebc5.poster.avif?t=1699112664\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622200/extras/232f487fa387d2d4d8de766c7458ebc5.webm?t=1699112664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622200/extras/232f487fa387d2d4d8de766c7458ebc5.mp4?t=1699112664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2>Enjoy the lifechanging, inspiring and mindblowing gameplay of Staring Contest, and becoming an unstoppable, professional starer in the process. Game contains 7 opponents, ranging in difficulty and trickery. Will your opponent's stare prove too hard?<br><br><i>&quot;Staring Contest is an odyssey, a tearless journey into the abyss of the human soul. It's the game you didn't know you needed until now.&quot; - Alberto</i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622200/extras/1b8b04ab317c054b9824966de86c111e.poster.avif?t=1699112664\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622200/extras/1b8b04ab317c054b9824966de86c111e.webm?t=1699112664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622200/extras/1b8b04ab317c054b9824966de86c111e.mp4?t=1699112664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Opponents featured:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Alberto\ud83d\udc68<br></li><li>Pepito\ud83e\uddd2<br></li><li>Mr. Skeleton AKA Skelly\ud83d\udc80\ud83e\uddb4<br></li><li>Moai\ud83d\uddff<br></li><li>Potato\ud83e\udd54<br></li><li>Lizard\